		{
			"id": "root",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 900,
			"y": -620,
			"width": 640,
			"height": 149,
			"text": "# 🐾 Bluey Number Guessing Game\nGuess the secret number from **1 to 100** in **5 tries**.\nEach file has **one job** — follow the branches to see who does what.",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "plan",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -260,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 115,
			"text": "## 📋 The Plan\n*Written before any code*",
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "claude",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 40,
			"y": -95,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 300,
			"text": "### [[CLAUDE.md]] — the rulebook\n- Number from 1–100, 5 guesses\n- Say **too high / too low / correct**\n- Always show guesses left\n- Pop-up when you win or lose\n- Closing it starts a new game\n- Keep it simple!",
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "wireframe",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "resources/number guessing wireframe.png",
			"x": 40,
