		},
		{
			"id": "js",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1320,
			"y": -260,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 141,
			"text": "## ⚙️ [[script.js]]\n**The referee** — makes the game *work*",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "j-settings",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1360,
			"y": -69,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 135,
			"text": "### Settings\n- Numbers 1–100\n- 5 guesses",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "j-memory",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1360,
			"y": 90,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 135,
			"text": "### Remembers\n- The secret number\n- How many guesses are left",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "j-start",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1360,
			"y": 249,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 161,
			"text": "### `startNewGame()`\n- Picks a new secret number\n- Resets guesses to 5\n- Clears the screen",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "j-guess",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1360,
			"y": 434,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 161,
			"text": "### `handleGuess()`\n- Checks the guess is 1–100\n- Uses up a guess\n- Too high? Too low? Correct?",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "j-feedback",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1360,
			"y": 619,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 135,
			"text": "### `showFeedback()`\n- Writes the message\n- Picks its colour",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "j-showpopup",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1360,
			"y": 778,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 187,
			"text": "### `showPopup()`\n- Win or lose message\n- Shows the secret number if you lost\n- Locks the guess box",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "j-close",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1360,
			"y": 989,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 161,
			"text": "### `closePopup()`\n- Waits 1 second first ⏱️\n- Hides the pop-up\n- Starts a new game",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "tools",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2800,
			"y": -260,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 141,
			"text": "## 🛠️ Helpers\n*Not part of the game — they help us build it*",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "t-qa",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2840,
			"y": -69,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 265,
			"text": "### 🧪 qa-agent\n- Plays the game in a real browser using **Playwright**\n- Checks features + phone & desktop layout\n- Needs Playwright added with:\n`claude mcp add playwright -- npx @playwright/mcp@latest`",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "t-mapper",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2840,
			"y": 220,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 161,
			"text": "### 🗺️ project-mapper\n- Reads the code (can't change it)\n- Writes the documentation",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "t-map",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2840,
			"y": 405,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 135,
			"text": "### 📖 [[PROJECT_MAP.md]]\n- The full written guide, with line numbers",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "t-save",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2840,
			"y": 564,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 239,
			"text": "### 💾 /save-project skill\n- Saves your work to GitHub\n- Commits + pushes with your message\n- Sets up Git or a new GitHub repo if missing\n`/save-project message:...`",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "t-grab",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2840,
			"y": 827,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 213,
			"text": "### 📥 /grab-project skill\n- Downloads a project from GitHub\n- Or pulls the latest version into this one\n`/grab-project github-url:...`",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "g-git",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 3280,
			"y": 564,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 187,
			"text": "### 🔧 Git CLI\n- `git init` · `commit` · `push` · `pull` · `clone`\n- Signs in with the **gh** CLI's GitHub login"
		},
		{
			"id": "g-mcp",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 3280,
			"y": 827,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 161,
			"text": "### 🐙 GitHub MCP\n- Checks a repo exists\n- Creates new repos\n- Uses its **own** access token"
		},
		{
			"id": "g-hub",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 3720,
			"y": 696.0,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 187,
			"text": "### ☁️ GitHub\n[kabeier/test-repo](https://github.com/kabeier/test-repo)\n- The online copy of this project",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "f1",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1880,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 135,
			"text": "### 1️⃣ Page loads\nA secret number is picked\n⚙️ `startNewGame()`",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "f2",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1880,
			"y": 195,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 135,
			"text": "### 2️⃣ Player types a guess\n…and presses **Enter** or **Guess**\n⚙️ `handleGuess()`",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "f3",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1880,
			"y": 390,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 118,
			"text": "### 3️⃣ Is it a whole number from 1–100?",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "f3no",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2320,
			"y": 370,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 187,
			"text": "### ⚠️ Not valid\n“Please enter a whole number from 1 to 100.”\n**No guess used up**\n⚙️ `showFeedback()`",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "f4",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1880,
			"y": 568,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 135,
			"text": "### 4️⃣ Use up one guess\nCompare with the secret number\n⚙️ `handleGuess()`",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "f4hint",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2320,
			"y": 578,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 135,
			"text": "### 🔴 Too high / Too low\nGuesses left? Try again!\n⚙️ `showFeedback()`",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "f5win",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1880,
			"y": 793,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 187,
			"text": "### 🎉 Correct!\nGreen pop-up\n**Play Again**\n⚙️ `showPopup()`",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "f5lose",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2160,
			"y": 793,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 187,
			"text": "### 😢 Out of guesses\nRed pop-up shows the number\n**Try Again**\n⚙️ `showPopup()`",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "f6",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1880,
			"y": 1040,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 161,
			"text": "### 5️⃣ Player closes the pop-up\n(ignored for the first second, so a quick extra Enter can't skip it)\n⚙️ `closePopup()`",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "f7",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1880,
			"y": 1261,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 144,
			"text": "### 🔁 New game starts automatically\n⚙️ `startNewGame()`",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "legend",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -620,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 317,
			"text": "### 🗝️ How to read this map\n**Colours**\n🟣 plan · 🔵 index.html · 🟠 style.css · 🟢 script.js · 🟡 helpers & skills\n\n**Arrows**\n- Grey: *this file contains…*\n- Red, labelled: *files talking to each other*\n- Green/red in the game box: *what happens next*\n- Cyan: *which function handles that step*"
		}
	],
